#paper-abstract[Let $U$ be a unipotent radical of a Borel subgroup of a Lie-type
  group over a finite field. For the classical types the Thompson subgroups and
  large abelian subgroups of the group $U$ were found by the middle 1980’s. We
  complete a solution of the well-known problem of their description for the
  exceptional Lie-types.]

#paper-keywords[Lie-type group, unipotent subgroup, large abelian subgroup,
  Thompson subgroup.]


